        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86343, Traditional Spindle Back-to-Back Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditionally styled Urn Tip Back-to-Back Door Pull Pair has an elegance that makes it a great choice for your historic home remodel. The Spindle Back-to-Back Handle Pair comes with everything you'll need to install it on doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. Choose from a huge selection of beautiful finishes including black, brass, and satin nickel. The Spindle Pull is available in 18 inch and 12 inch center to center lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/urn-tip-thru-bolt-door-pull-emtek-86343\"><b>Urn Tip Spindle Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Spindle Front Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86343-specification.pdf?v=1704262359\"><b>Emtek Spindle Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86343:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86344:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-9-finish.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"597\" height=\"89\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
